{"id":1029,"date":"2016-04-28T07:05:09","date_gmt":"2016-04-28T12:05:09","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/herbbaldwin.wordpress.com\/?p=1029"},"modified":"2016-06-06T19:13:31","modified_gmt":"2016-06-07T00:13:31","slug":"found-a-great-little-park-yuma-tn","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/2016\/04\/28\/found-a-great-little-park-yuma-tn\/","title":{"rendered":"Found a Great Little Park (Yuma, TN)"},"content":{"rendered":"<p>Having made it through Oklahoma Tuesday (missing the storms), we pulled out of Morrilton, AR (never to stay in THAT campground again!) on Wednesday morning and motored our way continuing eastward on I-40 and settled at a beautiful little independent park known as <a href=\"http:\/\/www.parkerscrossroadsrvpark.com\/\" target=\"_blank\">Parkers Crossroads RV Park &amp; Campground<\/a> at Yuma, TN.<\/p>\n<p>We found it on <a href=\"http:\/\/www.allstays.com\/\">AllStays.com<\/a> and wanted to stay here because it is about halfway between Memphis and Nashville and it&#8217;s about a mile or so north of the freeway so there would be far less truck traffic noise.[wpvideo fQ9zA7Vq]<\/p>\n<p>We found the place easily, identified by one of those bright LED fluorescent color signs that so many churches and gas stations seem to be using nowadays. \u00a0When we pulled in, we were warmly welcomed by Steve, one of the owners who gave us a nice written color brochure of the park along with a list of all the points of interest in the area. \u00a0His business partner (Mike) jumped into the Gator and led us to site 31, showed us that we were right next to one of the wifi repeaters, and\u00a0told us to look them up if there was anything we needed for the night.<\/p>\n<p>We found this to be one of the nicer RV parks we&#8217;ve been at. \u00a0Not only were we welcomed with kindness, but the park has; trees, a lake, concrete pads, hilltop sites, cable tv, wifi internet access, a community room w\/ 60&#8243; color tv and loads of DVD&#8217;s, and a nice little store for some groceries, rv parts and accessories, and oh yes &#8230; ice cream for Kathy!<\/p>\n<div id='gallery-1' class='gallery galleryid-1029 gallery-columns-3 gallery-size-thumbnail'><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/04\/2016-04-27-18-26-06.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/04\/2016-04-27-18-26-06-150x150.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"\" aria-describedby=\"gallery-1-1057\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<figcaption class='wp-caption-text gallery-caption' id='gallery-1-1057'>\n\t\t\t\tThe farm @ the back of the park\n\t\t\t\t<\/figcaption><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/04\/2016-04-27-18-40-41.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/04\/2016-04-27-18-40-41-150x150.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"\" aria-describedby=\"gallery-1-1056\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<figcaption class='wp-caption-text gallery-caption' id='gallery-1-1056'>\n\t\t\t\tSunset from our site\n\t\t\t\t<\/figcaption><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/04\/2016-04-27-18-25-36.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/04\/2016-04-27-18-25-36-150x150.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"\" aria-describedby=\"gallery-1-1059\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<figcaption class='wp-caption-text gallery-caption' id='gallery-1-1059'>\n\t\t\t\tAttractive cattle ranch in our back yard\n\t\t\t\t<\/figcaption><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/04\/2016-04-27-18-25-51.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/04\/2016-04-27-18-25-51-150x150.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/04\/2016-04-27-18-16-05.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/04\/2016-04-27-18-16-05-150x150.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"\" aria-describedby=\"gallery-1-1060\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<figcaption class='wp-caption-text gallery-caption' id='gallery-1-1060'>\n\t\t\t\tLots of space around the sites\n\t\t\t\t<\/figcaption><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/04\/2016-04-27-15-41-47.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/04\/2016-04-27-15-41-47-150x150.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"\" aria-describedby=\"gallery-1-1062\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<figcaption class='wp-caption-text gallery-caption' id='gallery-1-1062'>\n\t\t\t\tOur site at dusk\n\t\t\t\t<\/figcaption><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/04\/2016-04-27-18-14-54.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/04\/2016-04-27-18-14-54-150x150.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"\" aria-describedby=\"gallery-1-1061\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<figcaption class='wp-caption-text gallery-caption' id='gallery-1-1061'>\n\t\t\t\tThe lake and fishing pier\n\t\t\t\t<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Having made it through Oklahoma Tuesday (missing the storms), we pulled out of Morrilton, AR (never to stay in THAT campground again!) on Wednesday morning and motored our way continuing eastward on I-40 and settled at a beautiful little independent park known as Parkers Crossroads RV Park &amp; Campground at Yuma, TN. We found it &hellip; <a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/2016\/04\/28\/found-a-great-little-park-yuma-tn\/\" class=\"more-link\">Continue reading <span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Found a Great Little Park (Yuma, TN)<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"footnotes":""},"categories":[13403,19546],"tags":[18086,1406528,21395,230962],"class_list":["post-1029","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","hentry","category-camping","category-sightseeing","tag-lake","tag-rv-park","tag-storms","tag-yuma"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/1029","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=1029"}],"version-history":[{"count":24,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/1029\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":1157,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/1029\/revisio